			"date": "2023-05-03T16:51:21.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Just turn the Queen sized mattress sideways, Zach. 5 feet long, 6½ feet wide. 😁</p><p>(Also, looking up mattress sizes (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bed_size#North_America\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bed_size</span><span class=\"invisible\">#North_America</span></a>) just makes me angry. Why isn't a king bed just square? 3½ inches longer than wide? Who picked that? Clearly not someone who's ever had to put a fitted sheet on a bed!!!)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
